; The Lumen Accord's minelayer (ADR 0037 section 8, GDD): unarmed, plants the pulse seed for 50
; credits, finds mines within 3 tiles and never sets one off. It needs the radar. The GDD leaves its
; own price, hit points, speed and armour class to this row: all of them, the build time, sight and
; radii are starting values for the balance run (light and fast on the Accord's side). Not in the roster
; until its art (P292).
